{"audio": "narracion.mp3", "duracion": 71.63, "escenas": [{"ini": 0.0, "fin": 4.4, "texto": "Hay dos compradores que no miran cuánto gana el país. ¿Quiénes son?", "palabras": [{"w": "Hay", "ini": 0.0, "fin": 0.2}, {"w": "dos", "ini": 0.2, "fin": 0.52}, {"w": "compradores", "ini": 0.52, "fin": 1.16}, {"w": "que", "ini": 1.16, "fin": 1.4}, {"w": "no", "ini": 1.4, "fin": 1.68}, {"w": "miran", "ini": 1.68, "fin": 2.1}, {"w": "cuánto", "ini": 2.1, "fin": 2.56}, {"w": "gana", "ini": 2.56, "fin": 2.8}, {"w": "el", "ini": 2.8, "fin": 2.96}, {"w": "país.", "ini": 2.96, "fin": 3.2}, {"w": "¿Quiénes", "ini": 3.8, "fin": 4.22}, {"w": "son?", "ini": 4.22, "fin": 4.4}]}, {"ini": 5.02, "fin": 12.32, "texto": "El primero es el Gobierno. Su gasto, G, lo fija el presupuesto: no sube ni baja con la renta.", "palabras": [{"w": "El", "ini": 5.02, "fin": 5.18}, {"w": "primero", "ini": 5.18, "fin": 5.56}, {"w": "es", "ini": 5.56, "fin": 5.94}, {"w": "el", "ini": 5.94, "fin": 6.06}, {"w": "Gobierno.", "ini": 6.06, "fin": 6.36}, {"w": "Su", "ini": 6.96, "fin": 7.2}, {"w": "gasto,", "ini": 7.2, "fin": 7.8}, {"w": "G,", "ini": 7.96, "fin": 8.2}, {"w": "lo", "ini": 8.7, "fin": 8.82}, {"w": "fija", "ini": 8.82, "fin": 9.14}, {"w": "el", "ini": 9.14, "fin": 9.3}, {"w": "presupuesto:", "ini": 9.3, "fin": 9.9}, {"w": "no", "ini": 10.34, "fin": 10.52}, {"w": "sube", "ini": 10.52, "fin": 10.98}, {"w": "ni", "ini": 10.98, "fin": 11.2}, {"w": "baja", "ini": 11.2, "fin": 11.52}, {"w": "con", "ini": 11.52, "fin": 11.74}, {"w": "la", "ini": 11.74, "fin": 11.88}, {"w": "renta.", "ini": 11.88, "fin": 12.32}]}, {"ini": 12.72, "fin": 14.56, "texto": "Por eso decimos que es autónomo.", "palabras": [{"w": "Por", "ini": 12.72, "fin": 12.86}, {"w": "eso", "ini": 12.86, "fin": 13.04}, {"w": "decimos", "ini": 13.04, "fin": 13.48}, {"w": "que", "ini": 13.48, "fin": 13.76}, {"w": "es", "ini": 13.76, "fin": 13.96}, {"w": "autónomo.", "ini": 13.96, "fin": 14.56}]}, {"ini": 15.0, "fin": 20.46, "texto": "Este año, la mi